  "decision_agency": "Borough",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development by reason of the provision of insufficient internal living space for the first floor flat, the provision of inadequate, usable outdoor amenity space, and the provision of noise generating rooms above and below noise sensitive rooms resulting in an inappropriate vertical stacking of rooms between floors would provide substandard accommodation to the detriment of the amenities of future occupiers of the flats. As such, the proposal is contrary to policies 4.1, 4.11 and 5.5 of the adopted Ealing Unitary Development Plan, 'Plan for the Environment' (2004) and Supplementary Planning Document 10 (Noise and Vibration), policy 1.1(e) of the adopted Ealing Development (Core) Strategy (2012), policy 7A of the  Ealing Draft Development Management Development Plan Document (February 2013),  London Plan (2011) policies 3.2, 3.5, 7.6 and 7.15  and the NPPF."
  ],
